      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Enigmatic thigh pain remains a difficult problem to treat after total hip arthroplasty. This article reports on the use of strut cortical allografting for the treatment of recalcitrant enigmatic thigh pain following total hip arthroplasty in patients with a well-fixed cemented or cementless femoral component."},
